Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CRIT-0: outcome_tracker.py
  - Backfill all 42 legacy records: trade_type=MOMENTUM, regime_at_entry from ledger
  - 6 exit paths resolved from ledger (math_trim), 36 still need live Alpaca API run
  - regime_at_entry captured for MATH-1 regime-conditional IC
  - Atomic JSON writes (os.replace) — crash-safe
  - print_summary() now shows exit path + trade type breakdowns

CRIT-1: main.py — velocity gate wired in
  - _velocity_filter(): skip entry if composite dropped >0.20 vs yesterday
  - _load_composite_cache() / _save_composite_cache() — atomic reads/writes
  - Cache saved BEFORE held-symbol filter so full scored universe is captured

CRIT-2: main.py — cooldown gate wired in
  - _cooldown_filter(): skip entry if symbol in cooldown_log.json with future expiry
  - Both gates applied after signal generation, before EntryAgent screening

CRIT-3/4/8: signals.py — AdaptiveWeights rebuilt
  - Spearman rank IC replaces binary sign-match IC (Grinold & Kahn 1999)
  - Exponential decay weights (λ=0.005, half-life 139d) on Ridge and IC
  - Weighted ridge regression (WLS): X.T@W@X instead of X.T@X
  - Per-book weight files: adaptive_weights_MOMENTUM.json + adaptive_weights_MEAN_REVERSION.json
  - QuantSignalEngine now has self.adaptive_mom + self.adaptive_mr

CRIT-5: Atomic JSON writes
  - hold_monitor.py: save_history() + save_health() use os.replace
  - exit_monitor.py: trim_log + hold_health afternoon rescore writes atomic
  - main.py: composite_cache writes atomic
  - outcome_tracker.py: outcome_log writes atomic
